@startuml Roots of Impact - User Journey
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

|#LightGreen|Guest User|
start
:Register/Login;
:View Dashboard;
:Browse Available Tasks;
note right
  Video tasks
  QR code challenges
  Photo tasks
end note

|#LightBlue|Task Execution|
:Select Task;
if (Video Task?) then (yes)
  :Watch Video;
  :Answer Quiz Questions;
  :Submit Answers;
elseif (QR Code Task?) then (yes)
  :Scan QR Code at Location;
  :Code Verified;
else (Photo Task)
  :Upload Photo as Proof;
  :Submit Photo;
endif

|#LightGreen|Reward System|
:Points Awarded;
:Tree Planted in Forest;
:Check Rewards Available;
:Redeem Reward for Points;
:Receive Voucher Code;

|#LightGreen|Engagement|
:View Virtual Forest;
:Check Statistics;
:See Team Leaderboard;
stop

|#Yellow|Employee User|
start
:Login HotelKit Sync;
:View Employee Tasks;
:Complete Sustainability Task;
:HotelKit Sync Updates;
:Receive Team Benefits;
stop

@enduml